{
  "status": "placeholder",
  "note": "Version 2 onboarding (M-1.8) — Sex at birth routes banks. Order: sex → pronouns → age×sex banks → identity (always) → Deborah. Non-binary is identity-only (sex Prefer not to say uses that bank). Pronouns do not change banks. Under-13 Myself → M-1.10 sheet. Wording placeholder pending Deborah.",
